mindmap
  root((Web APIs and Protocols))
    RESTful
      Resources as Nouns
      HTTP Methods: GET POST PUT PATCH DELETE
      Status Codes: 200 201 204 400 401 403 404
      HATEOAS: Hypermedia Links
      Versioning: URI / Header / Query
    WebSockets
      Full-Duplex over TCP
      Upgrade Handshake HTTP 101
      Frame: FIN RSV Opcode Mask Payload
      Use Cases: chat, live updates, gaming
    gRPC
      Protocol Buffers
      HTTP/2 Transport
      Service Types
        Unary
        Server Streaming
        Client Streaming
        Bidirectional Streaming
    GraphQL
      Client-Driven Queries
      Single Endpoint
      Schema: Types, Queries, Mutations
      Batching with DataLoader
      Security: depth limiting, rate limiting
    Server-Sent Events
      Unidirectional Server to Client
      text/event-stream
      Auto-Reconnection
      Notifications and Live Feeds
    WebRTC
      Peer-to-Peer Media
      Signaling via SDP
      NAT Traversal: STUN TURN ICE
      DTLS-SRTP Encryption
      DataChannel: SCTP over DTLS
    API Gateway
      Request Routing
      Auth and Rate Limiting
      Caching and Transformation
      Monitoring and Analytics